Subject: Welcome to Media Manipulator

Hi Alina,

Your account is ready. Here is what it gives you:

- A history of your conversions, so you can find and download results again.
- A retention choice: you decide how long we keep your files, from 24 hours up to 2 years (6 months by default).
- Darkroom projects saved to your account, so your edits are there when you come back.

Open your account: https://media-manipulator.com/he/account

You can choose which emails you get in your account settings:

Manage email preferences: https://media-manipulator.com/he/account?tab=profile

The Media Manipulator team

